---
// Ian's opinionated aside. Distinct amber styling so it visually reads as a
// personal note, not a system callout (which is .quick-answer's role).
//
// Use sparingly — once per post — for a contrarian or experience-based claim.
//
// USAGE in MDX posts:
//   <MyTake>
//     I've watched four companies pick Zapier first because it was familiar,
//     then rebuild on n8n 18 months later when the bill hit $800/mo. If you
//     know you'll have >2,000 tasks/mo by Q4, just start on n8n.
//   </MyTake>
---

<aside class="my-take">
  <span class="my-take-eyebrow">My take</span>
  <div class="my-take-body"><slot /></div>
</aside>
